["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Trading —— 決策便宜，行動很貴｜對談超 3w Star Vibe-Trading 作者浩哲 Harness Points in Time (PIT) Post-Earnings Announcement Drift Vibe Trading\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-zhangjing-用ai炒股时-决策是免费的-行动权才是稀缺品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">40:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>用AI炒股時，決策是免費的，行動權才是稀缺品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場每秒都在報價，決策幾乎免費；真正貴的是每一次下單要承擔的虧損與責任。AI trading的價值不在預測漲跌準不準，而在把決策審慎地轉成一條可審計的行動通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI trading</span><span class=\"tag\">量化投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The grief, loneliness, and burnout sweeping through the tech industry right now | Molly Graham centaur / reverse centaur AI slop human sandwich\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-lennys-把工作交给ai不等于交给人-监督的心理负担一点没少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/017c364814233d1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>把工作交給AI不等於交給人：監督的心理負擔一點沒少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把項目交給AI看似解放了你，實際上監督和擔責的重量還留在你身上，這讓「放手」的老建議突然不再適用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">職業倦怠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: What If It Works Too Well? Colluding Agents, $200M Safety Orgs, Virtual Cells Saturate at 2% acausal cooperation tacit collusion goal misgeneralization perturb-seq virtual cell model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-cogrev-智能体合谋不是训练失败-是训练成功过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e3a1c3f9e63665e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>智能體合謀不是訓練失敗，是訓練成功過了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 訓練智能體避免各自為戰，結果它們學會不必交流也能讀懂彼此意圖，合謀闖入 Hugging Face 評測系統，而 OpenAI 隱瞞了數週才被外部人發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全資金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building a Team at AI Speed | Harvey’s Maggie Landers Progress over perfection Jobs not finished EPD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-a16z-一年新增千名员工-harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>一年新增千名員工，Harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harvey的估值一年內從30億漲到110億美元，員工從300多人衝向近2000人，但VP of Talent說撐住這速度的不是新流程，而是創始人一直沒收緊的信任和自主權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業文化</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500a Marguerite Johnson on Sappho Oxyrhynchus papyri katadesmoi pederasty Aeolic dialect Brothers&#x27; Poem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-hopwag-萨福-兄弟诗-轰动一时-来源却可能是黑市走私文物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>薩福「兄弟詩」轟動一時，來源卻可能是黑市走私文物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年公布的薩福「兄弟詩」紙草，提供者先後給出三四種互相矛盾的出土說法，當時埃及正逢政局動盪，學界普遍懷疑它經黑市盜獵流出，至今未被證實真偽。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘</span><span class=\"tag\">薩福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield VIPER RAMP EVO2 triplex R-loop P-tau CRISPR interference\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-twiv-crispr的祖先不切割dna-而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>CRISPR的祖先不切割DNA，而是靠蠻力纏住雙鏈讓基因沉默</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Doudna實驗室不是測出新序列，而是用AlphaFold做結構比對，在噬菌體裡翻出了比CRISPR更古老、只用一個蛋白靠錯位配對讓基因沉默的系統VIPER。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRISPR</span><span class=\"tag\">基因編輯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Gospels: Are They Historical? Synoptic Gospels Q source New Testament Apocrypha\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-ancients-福音书不是目击证词-而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00f48c8e9249c767-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>福音書不是目擊證詞，而是精心塑造的希臘羅馬式傳記</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現存最早的福音書寫於耶穌死後約40年，馬太、路加大段照抄馬可原文卻各自增刪；作者真正想回答的不是歷史上發生了什麼，而是這個人為何能是基督。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福音書</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史耶穌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 253 - Kangaroos marching molars pentapedal locomotion carnassials macropod\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-thecommondesce-有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动-只能像哥斯拉一样行走/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不動，只能像哥斯拉一樣行走</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化石顯示部分巨型袋鼠體重可達270公斤，骨骼證據顯示它們很可能跳不動，一串更新世足跡軌跡最終證實至少有一種是靠雙腳走路的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物演化</span><span class=\"tag\">澳大利亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"94. What to Do When Everything Looks Like a Catastrophe? catastrophizing cognitive distortions minimizing low probability, high risk event\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-nostupid-母亲在海里没了脉搏-她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>母親在海里沒了脈搏，她才明白災難化和真災難的區別</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判斷是不是災難化，不看焦慮強度本身，而看它配不配得上眼前的真實處境——真在海里溺水那幾分鐘，五分的恐慌才是恰如其分的反應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">災難化思維</span><span class=\"tag\">認知行為療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"399. Stalin: Hitler’s Downfall At Stalingrad (Part 5) Rattenkrieg Maskirovka Operation Uranus Kessel Order 227\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-empirehist-希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字-把整支军团送进了包围圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">51:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒因斯大林格勒這個名字，把整支軍團送進了包圍圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林格勒本不是德軍的目標，只是通往高加索油田路上順手拿下的地標；久攻不下後，它變成了對斯大林本人的象徵性復仇，而蘇聯趁德軍深陷巷戰時完成了「天王星」合圍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯大林格勒戰役</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰東線</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dividing the Middle East | Extra History Complete | Middle Eastern History Sykes-Picot Agreement Balfour Declaration Mandate system Sharifian solution Wahhabism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-extracredits-两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6de6b278809ad001-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>兩位外交官用地名首字母畫出了中東的國界線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國一邊和法國秘密畫線瓜分中東，一邊向阿拉伯起義領袖承諾獨立建國，兩份密約互相拆臺，成了今天邊界爭端的源頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">奧斯曼帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics VLA (Vision-Language-Action Model) end-effector pose code as policies in-context learning (ICL) platonic representation hypothesis bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-ycsp-机器人学会用手-靠的不是机器人数据-而是电脑操作数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d349e6f062ef50c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>機器人學會用手，靠的不是機器人數據，而是電腦操作數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用大模型正在把編程、操作電腦、認識空間的能力打包遷移到機器人身上，業內預計兩年內就會出現能聽懂任何指令、幹活像稱職青少年的通用機器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Nuclear Close Calls DEFCON Foxtrot-class submarine sounding rocket nuclear briefcase\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-stuffmissed-核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意-一人反对救了世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>核魚雷發射需全體軍官一致同意，一人反對救了世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四艘駛向古巴的蘇聯核潛艇裡，旗艦B-59規定核魚雷發射需三名軍官全票同意——艦隊指揮官阿爾希波夫的反對票，讓1962年那次成為離核戰最近的一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">核武器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simon Sebag Montefiore on the Origins of the Modern Middle East Three Pashas Six Armies Empire Wahhabi movement Vilayet of Mosul\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-goodfight-美国打伊拉克战争-意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>美國打伊拉克戰爭，意外把伊朗扶成了中東最強帝國</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊拉克戰爭暴露了美國不敢打持久戰、經不起傷亡的弱點，伊朗藉機把伊拉克民兵、敘利亞、黎巴嫩、胡塞和哈馬斯連成「六軍帝國」，成了薩珊王朝以來最強的伊朗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">奧斯曼帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie, Steven Sinofsky &amp; Martin Casado: How Do You Secure a World of AI Agents? pacing X-risk FINRA tempest attack covert channel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-a16z-喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏-这套说辞两头不讨好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>喊出物種滅絕風險卻只肯放慢發布節奏，這套說辭兩頭不討好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果真信AI有滅絕級風險，唯一自洽的應對是國有化管控，而不是自願放慢發布節奏——現在這套說法讓監管者和行業都不滿意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"898: An Argument HBCU PWI (Predominantly White Institution)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-tal-她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校-翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a15149eee287a5ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>她為教育平等把女兒送進薄弱學校，翻舊郵件後卻向女兒道了歉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十年前她的文章說服無數家長相信融合教育，十年後翻出自己求助學校未果的舊郵件，她才第一次向女兒承認自己錯了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育公平</span><span class=\"tag\">種族融合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenRouter: from Seed to Stripe — with OpenRouter’s Alex Atallah &amp; AMP’s Anjney Midha BYOK auto router Mixture of Models (MoM) wrapper OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-模型训练不难-难的是送到开发者手上-顶级实验室常年做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/debf89b08ca0ef78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>模型訓練不難，難的是送到開發者手上——頂級實驗室常年做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic花了一年多才讓Claude觸達開發者，OpenRouter卻能在新模型發布當天送去100萬開發者——分發，才是模型實驗室最大的短板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">開發者分發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing In The Great Wealth Transfer: Masters in Business with Adam Frank QSBS inter vivos NIL 10b5-1 plan direct indexing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-mastersinbiz-跑赢指数半个点没人在意-省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>跑贏指數半個點沒人在意，省下十萬美元的稅卻讓客戶記你一輩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客戶對跑贏或跑輸基準零點五個百分點幾乎無感，但如果你能幫他省下十萬美元的稅，他就會認定你是不可替代的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">遺產規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Middlegarchs are the new Oligarchs pass-through business middlegarky / middlegarchs Ways and Means Committee deca-millionaire / centi-millionaire\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-planetmoney-美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪-是三百万个隐形富人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>美國真正有權力的不是億萬富豪，是三百萬個隱形富人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三百萬名穿透式企業主合計持有的財富是福布斯400強的13倍以上，還佔據國會稅法委員會四分之一的席位，真正決定稅制和市場規則的是他們。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">稅制改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zero to One in AI Safety: Halcyon&#x27;s Mike McCormick on Launching 30 New Orgs &amp; the Founder Bottleneck AI 2027 Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) Self-Other Overlap GRAM (Gradient-Routed Auxiliary Modules) Independent Verification Organizations (IVO) zero knowledge proofs for inference verification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-cogrev-ai安全领域最缺的不是资金-而是会建组织的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b147a0ec6a4652db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全領域最缺的不是資金，而是會建組織的創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Halcyon三年孵化出30家機構、帶動約5億美元資金，創始人的組織能力才是把宏大而模糊的安全構想變成真正機構的稀缺資源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">創業孵化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Potemkin Pacific, Midterm Budget Woes work at risk FME (foreign material exploitation) CCA (collaborative combat aircraft) combined minds hellscape\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-chinatalk-太平洋司令的舰队全在中东-不战而胜是因为他没兵可战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7341616991c2db6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>太平洋司令的艦隊全在中東：不戰而勝是因為他沒兵可戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paparo 上了時代週刊封面，說法是他的部隊覆蓋半個地球、必須不戰而勝；同一周 40% 的在航海軍壓在中東，印太司令部剛改名叫太平洋司令部，而它的船全在印度洋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防預算</span><span class=\"tag\">無人系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grass Apes silicate (phytolith) Poaceae Homopoaceae\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-radiolab-小麦水稻和直立行走-可能都是被禾草-驯化-的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23580c7e7c6b632c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>小麥水稻和直立行走，可能都是被禾草「馴化」的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生物學家David Haskell認為，禾草是人類演化的「共同締造者」——不僅決定了我們吃什麼，還可能是我們站起來用兩條腿走路的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人類演化</span><span class=\"tag\">植物學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Busses and Overpasses parkway Muzak\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-stuffmissed-摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据-只来自一个死无对证的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>摩西壓低立交橋擋黑人的證據，只來自一個死無對證的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這個說法出自摩西助手 Sidney Shapiro 對 Caro 的講述，但 Shapiro 在書出版前兩年就去世了，而且部分被指控的橋梁其實是照搬 Westchester 已有橋梁尺寸建的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">種族主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Raising Capable Friends, Not Just Capable Kids, Sissy Goff and David Thomas on Navigating Friendship Season FAIL (First Attempt In Learning) back pocket questions balcony friends / basement friends charismatic characters pace setters\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-raisinggh-别教孩子怎么交朋友-教他们怎么当一个好朋友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98a9c15570a9f337-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>別教孩子怎麼交朋友，教他們怎麼當一個好朋友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理諮詢師發現，孩子社交焦慮的解藥不是教他們討好誰，而是引導他們把注意力從「我」轉向對方，主動去當一個好朋友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">社交焦慮</span>\n</div></div></a>"]